    "Per-switch isolated bias where very low primary-to-secondary capacitance is required.",
    "Regulated input rail; open-loop output varies with input and load."
  ],
  "design_considerations": [
    "Choose a transformer with high leakage inductance but low inter-winding capacitance; the leakage forms the resonant tank with the secondary capacitors.",
